00:00:29.293 --> 00:00:30.126
- Yes.

00:00:30.126 --> 00:00:32.571
- Like, how has life changed
since then obviously?

00:00:32.571 --> 00:00:34.940
Was it kinda crazy hard when you were 12?

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:37.550
- I mean, I don't
remember much before that.

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:38.530
- [Kelly] Oh wow.

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:39.363
- You know?

00:00:39.363 --> 00:00:40.196
12, 10.

00:00:41.303 --> 00:00:42.160
- [Kelly] You know what, I don't either.

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:43.697
When people ask about your
child- I don't remember a lot.

00:00:43.697 --> 00:00:45.820
- Do you remember when you were like 11?

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:46.653
- Not really.

00:00:46.653 --> 00:00:47.486
- Yeah.

00:00:47.486 --> 00:00:48.319
- Yeah.

00:00:48.319 --> 00:00:49.152
- Big moments.

00:00:49.152 --> 00:00:50.380
- Moments, the ones that
you maybe write songs about.

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:51.693
- Yeah, yeah, yes.

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:54.660
- So what kind of music
did you grow up with?

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:57.400
- I grew up listening to actually,

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:01.203
a lot of powerful female
artists, including you obviously.

00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:04.910
The first album I bought
was Lauryn Hill's album.

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:05.850
- [Kelly] Miss Educational.

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:06.792
- Yes.

00:01:06.792 --> 00:01:07.813
(audience claps)

00:01:07.813 --> 00:01:08.790
- Classic.

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:10.056
- That was one of my favorite too.

00:01:10.056 --> 00:01:11.390
- I bought that for myself and you know,

00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:14.414
Beyonce's first album,
Erica Badu, Missy Elliott,

00:01:14.414 --> 00:01:15.300
Lil' Kim.

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:16.133
- [Kelly] Wow.

00:01:16.133 --> 00:01:17.190
- Yes, very strong women.

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:19.460
- I know you like a strong
woman, I like that too,

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:20.300
that's cool.

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:21.133
Me too, I love it.

00:01:21.133 --> 00:01:24.010
What did you grow up with in
Mexico city, what was real big

00:01:24.010 --> 00:01:25.205
