use on stage and off stage.

00:03:02.452 --> 00:03:05.640
- Yeah, do you kind of become,
my mother was laughs at me

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:07.410
because she's like, I can tell it's like,

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:09.230
literally right when I finished the song,

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:11.300
then I become like the
bubbly me off stage.

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:12.270
- Yes.

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:14.930
- But during the song,
I'm like very in the zone,

00:03:14.930 --> 00:03:15.870
you're like that as well.

00:03:15.870 --> 00:03:16.703
- Yes.

00:03:16.703 --> 00:03:17.890
- We all have a Sasha fierce.

00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:20.203
- We all do and that's what
Alpha is about, my album so-

00:03:20.203 --> 00:03:22.610
- [Kelly] I love that, that's
why you titled it that?

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:23.443
- Yes.

00:03:23.443 --> 00:03:25.500
- I love that, is that where
you feel the most powerful?

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:26.333
Like in-

00:03:26.333 --> 00:03:27.166
- [CL] On stage.

00:03:27.166 --> 00:03:28.380
- Yeah.

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:31.420
- I'm a performer, so that's
where I feel comfortable.

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:32.980
And that's what I love doing.

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:34.260
- Yeah, I love your vibe,

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:35.540
I was watching while I
was getting ready today

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:36.760
and I was watching
rehearsals and I was like,

00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:37.685
oh my god-

00:03:37.685 --> 00:03:38.518
- You did?

00:03:38.518 --> 00:03:39.351
- [Kelly] I did, I was
watching and I was like,

00:03:39.351 --> 00:03:41.510
oh my gosh, and all the
dancer- it's so cool,

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:42.430
it's very, very cool.

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:43.263
- [CL] I had fun doing it.

00:03:43.263 --> 00:03:44.910
- And I love it too, 'cause
it starts off in you're like,

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:46.000
I don't want to ruin it anyway.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:48.179
I like the whole performance.

00:03:48.179 --> 00:03:50.930
But speaking of like
how artistic you looked,

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:52.866
you went to the Met Gala this
year, was that so much fun?

00:03:52.866 --> 00:03:55.750
- I love playing dress up so I had fun.

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.332
- [Kelly] Yeah, oh you enjoy it?

00:03:57.332 --> 00:03:58.165
(crowd cheers)

00:03:58.165 --> 00:04:00.940
- Yes, I love doing it.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.350
- [Kelly] By the way, I'm from Texas,

00:04:02.350 --> 00:04:04.280
so this is so, Texas.

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:05.180
This is like how Texas-

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:06.900
- The theme was Americana so yes,

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:09.266
that's why there was
the jeans and you know,

00:04:09.266 --> 00:04:11.600
I was wearing underwear.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:12.620
- I love-

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:13.453
(Kelly laughs)

00:04:13.453 --> 00:04:14.286
Good for you.

00:04:14.286 --> 00:04:15.510
- [CL] I was-

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:16.500
- Good for you.

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:18.540
(CL and Kelly laugh)

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:20.323
- No, that was a part of the dress.

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:22.660
- But it was cool because I heard

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:24.010
