00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:25.700
- Yes, it was Alexander Wang,

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:28.950
and you know, it did not look
like that in the beginning,

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:31.430
but I wanted to make sure
I melt my culture in there.

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:34.500
So, we had to change it in 24 hours.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:37.540
He made a completely new dress and the bow

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:40.130
is actually a traditional Korean, yeah.

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:42.970
- That's cool though, I
think that's my favorite

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:43.880
kind of art to where it's like,

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.140
you do take something that somebody makes,

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:46.240
but then you personalize it.

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:47.073
- [CL] Yes.

00:04:47.073 --> 00:04:47.980
- Like people covering songs.

00:04:47.980 --> 00:04:48.960
That's like my favorite thing they do.

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:50.710
- That's where the magic happens I think.

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:52.280
- [Kelly] That's so cool, I
love that you're into it all,

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:53.360
