00:04:58.986 --> 00:05:00.420
(Kelly laughs)

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:03.091
- Well it's, you know,
I'm just talking to my ex.

00:05:03.091 --> 00:05:04.240
- [Kelly] Oh I love that.

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:07.730
- Telling him you will never,
ever find a lover like me.

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:08.746
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:05:08.746 --> 00:05:09.810
(crowd cheers)

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:12.890
- I love that kind of
empowering statement.

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:14.495
Especially if you're like after a breakup,

00:05:14.495 --> 00:05:16.870
