to relate to that message.

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:18.230
- Yeah I was just like you know,

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:19.132
when you're brushing it off.

00:05:19.132 --> 00:05:19.965
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:05:19.965 --> 00:05:21.108
- Listen to that song,
you'll be like, yes.

00:05:21.108 --> 00:05:21.941
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:05:21.941 --> 00:05:23.040
- Yes.

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:23.873
- I love you.

